Team 34 DSA5205 Project 2

This repository contains a classroom research implementation and aggregate
experimental outputs. The code base is adapted from:
https://github.com/Panyuxiang0830/Quant_U.S._stocks

Data-ingestion patterns reference:
https://github.com/simonlin1212/global-stock-data

WorldQuant formula numbers reference Zura Kakushadze, 101 Formulaic Alphas
(2016), arXiv:1601.00991. The fundamental-factor reports are cited in the
English report and the source-linked factor catalog. The report implements
only the stated candidate subset and U.S. adaptations, not every formula or
each report's complete original trading strategy.

Existing source notices and provenance documents are retained. No additional
blanket license is asserted for third-party code, publications or data.
Commercial source data, security-level panels, trained models and credentials
are intentionally not redistributed. Team members must obtain required data
through their authorized institutional access.
